<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Patek Philippe × The Hour Glass — AKQA</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  :root {
    --serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    --sans: 'Inter', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    --black: #121212;
    --body: #414141;
    --muted: #9a9a9a;
    --rule: #e0e0e0;
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --bg-warm: #faf9f7;
  }

  html, body {
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    color: var(--body);
    background: var(--bg);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    line-height: 1.625;
  }

  /* ─── SLIDE DECK ─── */
  .deck {
    height: 100vh;
    overflow-y: scroll;
    scroll-snap-type: y mandatory;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  .slide {
    min-height: 100vh;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 60px 40px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .slide-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* ─── NAV BAR ─── */
  .topbar {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 40px;
    height: 48px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .topbar-brand {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--black);
  }

  .topbar-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .topbar-link {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0 20px;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .topbar-link:hover { color: var(--body); }
  .topbar-link.active { color: var(--black); border-bottom-color: var(--black); }

  .topbar-meta {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ─── PROGRESS BAR ─── */
  .progress-bar {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--black);
    z-index: 100;
    transition: width 0.3s ease;
  }

  /* ─── SLIDE INDICATOR ─── */
  .slide-dots {
    position: fixed;
    right: 28px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--muted);
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .dot:hover { border-color: var(--body); }
  .dot.active { background: var(--black); border-color: var(--black); }
  .dot.section-break { margin-top: 8px; }

  /* ─── KEYBOARD HINT ─── */
  .key-hint {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 20px;
    right: 28px;
    z-index: 100;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    opacity: 1;
    transition: opacity 0.6s;
  }
  .key-hint.hidden { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }

  /* ─── SLIDE NUMBER ─── */
  .slide-num {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 24px;
    left: 40px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  /* ─── TYPOGRAPHY ─── */
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  h1.hero { font-size: 64px; }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--body);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .lead {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--black);
  }

  .pullquote {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--black);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--black);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--black);
  }

  /* ─── JOURNEY ─── */
  .journey-item {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-left: 24px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .journey-item .j-num {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .journey-item .j-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--black);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .journey-item p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .journey-item a {
    color: var(--body);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .journey-item a:hover { color: var(--black); }

  /* ─── PLAYGROUND ─── */
  .play-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .play-col { padding: 20px 24px; }
  .play-col:first-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .play-col .play-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .play-col p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }

  /* ─── TERRITORY ─── */
  .territory-names {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--black);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .territory-names a {
    color: var(--black);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .territory-names a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--black); }

  .territory-thread {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ─── ASK ─── */
  .ask-block {
    background: var(--bg-warm);
    padding: 36px;
  }
  .ask-block p { font-size: 18px; }
  .ask-date {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--black);
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  /* ─── FOOTER LINE ─── */
  .brief-footer {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  /* ═══════ TIMELINE SLIDES ═══════ */
  .slide.timeline-slide {
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .slide.timeline-slide .slide-inner {
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  /* Counters */
  .counters {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .counter-card {
    padding: 24px 20px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .counter-card:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .counter-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .counter-value {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--black);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .counter-text {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .counter-card.urgent .counter-value { color: #b44; }

  /* Phases */
  .phase { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .phase-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .phase-name {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--black);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .phase-dates {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .phase-bar-bg {
    height: 28px;
    background: var(--bg-warm);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .phase-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--black);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 10px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--bg);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .phase-bar-fill.upcoming { background: var(--rule); color: var(--muted); }
  .phase-bar-fill.active-phase { background: var(--body); }

  /* Milestones */
  .ms-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .ms-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .ms-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--muted);
    margin-right: 14px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .ms-row.done .ms-dot { background: var(--black); border-color: var(--black); }
  .ms-row.gate .ms-dot { border-color: var(--black); border-width: 2.5px; }
  .ms-date {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 1px;
  }
  .ms-text {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--body);
  }
  .gate-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: var(--black);
    color: var(--bg);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  /* Actions */
  .act-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .act-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .act-row:hover { background: var(--bg-warm); }
  .act-check {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--muted);
    margin-right: 12px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .act-row.checked .act-check { background: var(--black); border-color: var(--black); }
  .act-row.checked .act-text { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: line-through; }
  .act-text {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--body);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .act-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .act-meta .today { color: #b44; font-weight: 500; }

  /* Flags grid for timeline */
  .flags-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .flag {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .flag.blocker { border-left-color: #b44; }
  .flag.risk { border-left-color: #b88a2a; }
  .flag.note { border-left-color: var(--muted); }
  .flag-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    display: block;
  }
  .flag.blocker .flag-label { color: #b44; }
  .flag.risk .flag-label { color: #b88a2a; }
  .flag.note .flag-label { color: var(--muted); }
  .flag-text {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--body);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Two-col layout for timeline detail slides */
  .tl-two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  /* ─── RESPONSIVE ─── */
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .slide { padding: 60px 24px; }
    h1 { font-size: 36px; }
    h1.hero { font-size: 42px; }
    .play-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .play-col:first-child { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .counters { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .counter-card:nth-child(2) { border-right: none; }
    .tl-two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .flags-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .slide-dots { display: none; }
    .topbar { padding: 0 20px; }
    .topbar-link { padding: 0 12px; }
  }

  /* ─── PRINT ─── */
  @media print {
    html, body { overflow: visible; height: auto; }
    .deck { overflow: visible; scroll-snap-type: none; }
    .slide { min-height: auto; page-break-after: always; padding: 40px; }
    .topbar, .slide-dots, .progress-bar, .key-hint { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- TOP BAR -->
<div class="topbar">
  <span class="topbar-brand">Patek Philippe × The Hour Glass</span>
  <div class="topbar-nav">
    <a class="topbar-link active" data-section="brief" onclick="goToSection('brief')">Brief</a>
    <a class="topbar-link" data-section="timeline" onclick="goToSection('timeline')">Timeline</a>
  </div>
  <span class="topbar-meta">AKQA — Internal</span>
</div>

<!-- PROGRESS BAR -->
<div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>

<!-- DOT NAV -->
<div class="slide-dots" id="dotNav"></div>

<!-- KEYBOARD HINT -->
<div class="key-hint" id="keyHint">↑ ↓ arrows to navigate</div>

<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- SLIDE DECK -->
<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="deck" id="deck">

  <!-- ───── BRIEF SLIDES ───── -->

  <!-- 1. TITLE -->
  <div class="slide" data-section="brief">
    <div class="slide-inner" style="text-align:left;">
      <div class="kicker">Patek Philippe × The Hour Glass</div>
      <h1 class="hero">The private room,<br>at scale</h1>
      <p class="subtitle" style="margin-top:16px;">Strategic brief for the design team — March 2026</p>
      <div class="brief-footer" style="margin-top:48px;">Erik Posthuma — CGO, APAC — AKQA / Aleph Labs</div>
    </div>
    <div class="slide-num"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. BACKGROUND -->
  <div class="slide" data-section="brief">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <div class="section-label">Background</div>
      <p>The Hour Glass is the authorised Patek Philippe retailer across Asia-Pacific — nine dedicated boutiques spanning Singapore, Kuala Lumpur, Sydney, Bangkok, Omotesando, and beyond. Patek Philippe sits within the Holy Trinity of watchmaking. Family-owned. Pure mechanical. Entry price: SGD 30,000+. Collector pieces reach into the millions. No sale without a relationship.</p>
      <p>The Hour Glass doesn't just adhere to that ethos — it amplifies it. Watch enthusiasts serving watch enthusiasts. Every specialist on the floor speaks the same language as the collector across the table.</p>
      <p>THG approached AKQA because of the Hermès website. Michael Tay, Group Managing Director, wants to see what happens when a network that understands luxury at that level builds the digital presence for the most exclusive watch brand on earth. He will review and approve all creative direction on March 23.</p>
      <p>Nine boutiques. Nine independent URLs — same structure per site. One chance to set the standard.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide-num"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 3. INSIGHT -->
  <div class="slide" data-section="brief">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <div class="section-label">The insight</div>
      <p class="lead">The new luxury isn't what you show — it's what you withhold. And it's because of what you withhold that you begin to speak a coded language. A Patek Philippe on the wrist isn't a status symbol — it's a recognition signal. You either read the dial or you don't. It is the ultimate expression of taste — belonging not through display, but through discernment.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:24px;">Patek Philippe is the purest expression of mechanical watchmaking. No quartz. No compromise. The Hour Glass is the partner who not only understands that purity but lives it — through its people, its operations, its obsession with craft. The digital experience must carry that same honesty forward.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide-num"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 4. TENSION -->
  <div class="slide" data-section="brief">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <div class="section-label">The tension</div>
      <p class="lead">The world's most considered watch brand has the most unconsidered digital presence.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:20px;">Every Patek boutique website today is a brochure — compliant, forgettable, identical. It treats a $500,000 collector the same as a passing browser. The boutique would never do this. The website does it every time.</p>
      <p>The opportunity isn't to redesign. It's to whisper luxury at the most extreme level. Not louder. More honest.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide-num"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 5. THE ASK -->
  <div class="slide" data-section="brief">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <div class="section-label">The ask</div>
      <div class="ask-block">
        <p>Design a digital experience worthy of the private room. Nine boutique websites that feel like being invited in — not marketed to. One design system, three visitor modes: the researcher, the connoisseur, the collector. Same room. Different lighting.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px;">Prove it with a working prototype, not a deck.</p>
        <p class="ask-date">Present to Michael Tay: March 23, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="slide-num"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 6. AUDIENCE -->
  <div class="slide" data-section="brief">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <div class="section-label">The audience</div>
      <p>These are the people at Art Basel, not the art fair. The ones whose Rolls-Royce was presented to them at an airshow, because that's where you find them. They notice when a typeface has been compromised, when a material has been substituted, when an experience has been templated. They don't browse — they appraise.</p>
      <p>But most importantly: they are enthusiasts. They care about movements, about finishing, about the difference between a Geneva Seal and a Hallmark of Geneva. The best way to earn their attention is to demonstrate that you understand what they understand. Watch enthusiasts serving watch enthusiasts — that's the standard online, just as it is in the boutique.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide-num"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 7. JOURNEY -->
  <div class="slide" data-section="brief">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <div class="section-label">The journey</div>
      <p style="margin-bottom:28px;">The website is one moment in a longer relationship. The strategy will address the full arc across three directions:</p>

      <div class="journey-item">
        <div class="j-num">Direction 1</div>
        <div class="j-title">Exceptional taste</div>
        <p>When a human lands on the site, it must be unmistakably, unambiguously global luxury. Not aspirational. Not "premium." The kind of restraint and precision that signals to the visitor: this was made by people who understand what you understand. The website is the first proof that this boutique is worthy of your time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-item">
        <div class="j-num">Direction 2</div>
        <div class="j-title">The digital concierge</div>
        <p>Drawing on AKQA's Generative Store thinking (ref: <a href="https://www.akqa.com/work/google/bringing-emotion-and-intuition-back-to-online-shopping/" target="_blank">AKQA × Cartier Generative Store</a>), the site adapts to who is looking — surfacing the right collections, the right depth, the right invitation at the right moment. No chatbot. No visible AI. The page itself is the intelligence.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-item">
        <div class="j-num">Direction 3</div>
        <div class="j-title">Discovery to relationship — GEO through to CRM</div>
        <p>The full pipeline. From Answer Engine Optimisation to adaptive concierge intake to AI-generated client briefs pushed directly into The Hour Glass CRM — so the watch specialist walks into the appointment already knowing. The relationship begins before the handshake.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="slide-num"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 8. PLAYGROUND + TERRITORY -->
  <div class="slide" data-section="brief">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <div class="section-label">The playground</div>
      <div class="play-grid">
        <div class="play-col">
          <div class="play-label">Play</div>
          <p>An end-to-end luxury experience — from how a collector discovers the boutique, through the website that earns their attention, to the concierge moment that begins the relationship, to the CRM integration that makes the boutique team's first conversation feel like a second. Generative personalisation. AI-powered concierge. Micro-interactions. Editorial storytelling. Collection as narrative, not catalogue.</p>
        </div>
